<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Engro Chemical net 77 pct up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Engro Chemical net 77 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31,</p>
<p>1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales			7,168 vs 4,520</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	1,645 vs   993</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	 1,386 vs   782</p>
<p>    Interim div 1st	 30 pct vs 20 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Interim div 2nd	 20 pct vs 20 pct</p>
<p>    Final dividend	  30 pct vs 20 pct</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks	    25 pct vs 20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Engro Chemical Pakistan Ltd. Book closure April 1-15. AGM on April 15. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
